==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Hidden Fates|Electrode|22}} from the {{TCG|Hidden Fates}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Electrode}}.
*'''Rolling Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Brock's Sandshrew|71}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

